  "prefLabel": "Plc 1502.26 Self-directed study program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1502.26 “Self-directed study program” means a program that is presented via audio, video, or computer programming at a time chosen by the licensee, which requires successful completion of an examination to obtain proof of completing the self-study program.\n\nSource. #13839, eff 12-28-23 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
